    "body": "Thank you for this report and the clear \"Done means\" list.\n\nTriage: **P3** (wrong behaviour that a user hits; the full-model operation is the workaround), **effort:high** (it changes toolpath output, so the safety floor applies), **area:multiaxis**.\n\nThe operation ignores the face selection without a message. That is the defect. The fix must also make sure that a selection the rotary operations cannot use gives a clear refusal, not a silent fallback to the full model.\n",
