    "body": "fix on issue/2848-rotary-face-selection · PR #2853 · pinned by rotary_parallel_keeps_its_cut_over_the_picked_faces, rotary_parallel_keeps_to_a_sector_and_still_turns_about_the_whole_models_axis, rotary_parallel_reads_a_welded_wall_pick_as_its_strips, rotary_parallel_refuses_a_selection_it_cannot_use_by_name, rotary_contour_and_offset_refuse_a_face_selection_by_name · merges when reviewed\n\nScope: Rotary Parallel keeps its passes to the picked faces. Rotary Contour and Rotary Offset refuse a face selection by name; they do not cut the full model silently. Face containment for those two kinds is in #2851 and #2852.\n",
